ools\">All</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=Image%20Tools\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=PDF%20Tools\">PDF Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=Video%20Tools\">Video Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=Audio%20Tools\">Audio Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=AI%20Creator%20Tools\">AI Creator Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300\" href=\"/tools?category=Text%20Tools\">Text Tools</a></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">JPG to PNG</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert JPG and JPEG images into PNG format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/jpg-to-png\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">PNG to JPG</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert PNG images into JPG format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/png-to-jpg\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">WEBP to JPG</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert WEBP images into JPG format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/webp-to-jpg\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">WEBP to PNG</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert WEBP images into PNG format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/webp-to-png\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">JPG to WEBP</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert JPG images into WEBP format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/jpg-to-webp\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">PNG to WEBP</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert PNG images into WEBP format online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/png-to-webp\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Compress Image</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Reduce image file size online for free while keeping good quality.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/compress-image\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Resize Image</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Resize images online for free. Change image width and height while maintaining quality.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/resize-image\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Crop Image</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Crop images online for free. Select a custom area and download the cropped image instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/crop-image\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Rotate Image</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Rotate images online for free. Turn JPG, PNG or WEBP images 90, 180 or 270 degrees and download instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/rotate-image\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Image to Base64</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert images to Base64 online for free. Encode JPG, PNG or WEBP images into Base64 text instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/image-to-base64\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Image Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Favicon Generator</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Create website favicons from JPG, PNG or WEBP images online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/favicon-generator\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">PDF Tools</div><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-bold\">Image to PDF</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Convert JPG, PNG or WEBP images to PDF online for free.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-5\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/convert/image-to-pdf\">Open tool</a></div></article><article class=\"flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl bord